---
title: "Nocturea — Independent design studio"
description: "Websites and visual identities for brands that refuse to look like everyone else. No templates, and one person from the first sketch to the last deployment."
active: home
---
<section class="noc-wrap noc-section--home-hero noc-rule-bottom">
  <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--hero">Independent design studio</p>
  <h1 class="noc-h1 noc-h1--home">Websites and visual identities for brands that <span class="noc-accent">refuse</span> to look like everyone else.</h1>
  <div class="noc-home-hero__foot">
    <p class="noc-lead noc-lead--lg">No templates. Just craft. Every project starts on a blank page, and one person carries it from the first sketch to the last deployment.</p>
    <div class="noc-btn-row">
      <a href="/work.html" class="noc-btn noc-btn--primary">See the work</a>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="noc-btn noc-btn--outline">Start a project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-reveal">
  <div class="noc-pillars">
    <div>
      <span class="noc-num noc-pillar__num">01</span>
      <h3>Zero templates</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">Nothing is reused between projects. Type, grid and palette are chosen for your brand and no one else's.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="noc-num noc-pillar__num">02</span>
      <h3>One person, start to finish</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">You talk to the person doing the work. No account manager, no handover, no brief lost in translation.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="noc-num noc-pillar__num">03</span>
      <h3>Revisions until you sign off</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">A project ends when you are satisfied with it, not when a fixed number of rounds runs out.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-section noc-reveal">
  <div class="noc-section-head">
    <h2 class="noc-label">Selected work</h2>
    <a href="/work.html" class="noc-more">All projects →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="noc-grid-3">
    {{- for project of projects.slice(0, 3) }}
    <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="noc-project-card">
      <div class="noc-project-card__shot">
        <img src="{{ project.image.src }}" width="{{ project.image.w }}" height="{{ project.image.h }}"
             alt="" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="noc-project-card__meta">
        <span class="noc-project-card__name">{{ project.name }}</span>
        <span class="noc-project-card__year">{{ project.year }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="noc-project-card__kind">{{ project.kind }}</div>
    </a>
    {{- /for }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="noc-rule-top noc-reveal">
  <div class="noc-wrap noc-section noc-cta">
    <div>
      <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--cta">Open for two projects this autumn</p>
      <h2 class="noc-h2">Tell me what you are building.</h2>
      <p>Three questions to answer: the project, the deadline, the budget. You get a written reply, not a sales call.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact.html" class="noc-btn noc-btn--primary noc-btn--lg">Contact</a>
  </div>
</section>
